{'symbol': 'CME', 'date': '2022-10-12 14:45:00', 'title': 'CME GROUP NAMES JONATHAN MARCUS AS GENERAL COUNSEL', 'text': "CHICAGO , OCT. 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CME GROUP, THE WORLD'S LEADING DERIVATIVES MARKETPLACE, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS NAMED JONATHAN MARCUS AS SENIOR MANAGING DIRECTOR AND GENERAL COUNSEL. MARCUS WILL SERVE AS THE CHIEF LEGAL ADVISOR FOR CME GROUP AND WILL OVERSEE THE COMPANY'S COMPLIANCE, ENTERPRISE RISK MANAGEMENT, LEGAL AND MARKET REGULATION FUNCTIONS."}